<title>UK: Chrysalis to close feature film business.</title>
<headline>Chrysalis to close feature film business.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chrysalis Group Plc said its Chrysalis Visual Entertainment unit is to restructure its feature film businesses.</p>
<p>Chrysalis Visual Entertainment's film production and film sales arms are to close because of difficult trading conditions.</p>
<p>But the company will keep its 49 percent interest in feature film company Scala Productions and will concentrate on building Scala into a significant UK-based film company.</p>
<p>Scala's recent films include Backbeat, The Neon Bible and Hollow Reed.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
